OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed wife 78 times
OL,4,Ajailed for 18 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 66-year-old, of Ascot Drive,
OL,7,FTamworth, was told by a judge he would
OL,8,Fserve a life sentence with a minimum of
OL,9,F20 years, minus time already spent on
OL,10,Fremand, at Stafford Crown Court on
OL,11,FTuesday.
